member.summary:
The expected operation of each column i, items, decided in this order:
when the column has a clock edge (i > 0 and i multiple of 6) that was cancelled by Preset or Clear active in column i − 1 (token ), even when the signal is still active in column i;
otherwise or when that signal is active in the column, even when Q does not change;
otherwise, in a column with a clock edge, the operation given by J and K sampled in column i − 1, as the operation hint of the game (OperationHint.ResolveOperation), even when Q does not change: (J = 1, K = 0), (J = 0, K = 1), (J = K = 1) or (J = K = 0);
otherwise .
